82236066928451_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3a9bs0G59jcQ7kNvwGxdMyq&_nc_oc=Adqmn8DmXhY3GE1g2Vn-w_S57C1XAP81s2kgD6PL1kVcJHj9qYbWZ09NWMCdRetoQD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIFpc2uaDz39liYNcNuafpbi796fmTEsLd7QSvnw8VJxg&oe=6AB3D67F"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Media Storage_Screenshot.png", "id": "3267266376829151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7-mVLwZmd0EQ7kNvwGO3dzJ&_nc_oc=AdpLvHEF28oAG3--lER-Xd8XEIncRROp8qVgEHbuuY51YvhiAnu1T-M3OHDIVc6ld-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKwSzssbrrMdYGB6hX5n41PRbZO71zYT6niIODRRLoJbw&oe=6AB3EFD6"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9HR-rH3thIcQ7kNvwEfjhJr&_nc_oc=AdpXF08cKDZrLS4GRUz7Tg7ISIzc3Wuftzl02TuXqk3sFRrBFqmPJSzpjYKt0yRI9IM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKU-4QU5mOhqZL41QDIVD0gs6HRZGHOc8ciCiNLm2dOJQ&oe=6AB3E6BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6-2pZvKBYkUQ7kNvwEbmo40&_nc_oc=AdoJ8LtIiygFsnh-k6SDLm3lyHEcxW2bTDkNvpV7675zJVoAskBm0gvRc3oMUNkhI0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJMDqxthAhDd12maLKz39VmLWvbpSOzxlOg1B87jIlx6w&oe=6AB3D9D5"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YoksBHAtK7UQ7kNvwGDmhbR&_nc_oc=AdowWzEfTZrArrxyxc-VNu5NPA9I1GaXl8kWP_JgonjPglGJsZnVJu5YzS_rUk9Mcy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLyB5Av_p